     "\r\n<font face=\"arial\" size=\"2\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Dear all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">The u<strong>pcoming Physalia online Analysis of Animal Movement Data </strong><strong>in R <strong>course </strong><strong></strong></strong> (24-28 March) is <strong>almost full</strong>!</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Join us to learn how to analyze <strong>animal telemetry data</strong> — from <strong>exploratory analysis</strong> to <strong>simulating space use</strong> with <strong>integrated step selection functions (iSSF)</strong> — through a mix of <strong>lectures, guided coding,</strong> and <strong>independent exercises</strong>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">For more information: <a href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/mve-r/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/mve-r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471586245000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Sy9RHYdUsS0ukcL0IMaJf\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/mve-r/</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Best regards,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Carlo</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:arial;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;font-size:small\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:trebuchet ms;font-size:10pt\">--------------------<br><br>Carlo Pecoraro, Ph.D<br><br><br>Physalia-courses DIRECTOR<br><br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">in...@physalia-courses.org</a><br><br><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/physaliacourses.bsky.social\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bsky.app/profile/physaliacourses.bsky.social&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471586245000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01nQQOXbiQnuIQWiElbXn4\">Bluesky</a> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/physalia-courses-a64418127/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.linkedin.com/in/physalia-courses-a64418127/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471586245000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0llOF-LUPl9Gu47sEhpIkU\">Linkedin</a></p></font>\r\n\r\n<br>"
